Bundle-Name: Fennec OData Vocabularies
Bundle-Description: OASIS standard vocabularies (Org.OData.Core/Capabilities/Validation/Measures V1) provided as EPackages, bootstrapped from their vendored CSDL definitions via the CSDL read path (req §3.4, Q5)
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.odata.csdl;version=project,\
	org.odata.csdl.model;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.emf.ecore.xmi;version=latest
